{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04076","headline":"奉和恩赐乐游园宴应制 · 苏頲","name":"奉和恩赐乐游园宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐游光地选，酺饮庆天从。\n座密千官盛，场开百戏容。\n绿塍际山尽，缇幕倚云重。\n下上花齐发，周廻柳遍浓。\n夺晴纷劒履，喧听杂歌钟。\n日晚衔恩散，尧人倂可封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04076.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04076","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}